Restore the green section kickers; scale leaderboard bars to 0-100

I had inverted the ihbench pattern: there the green kicker carries the
short label and the h2 carries a descriptive sentence. I had promoted
the labels to h2 and dropped the kickers entirely. Now each major part
has its kicker back - What is Instruct-FD?, Scoring, Results, Pipeline,
Leaderboard - above a real title. The taxonomy section reads as a
continuation of the opening part, so it has no kicker of its own, as
with the unlabelled sections in ihbench.

Leaderboard bars now measure against the full 0-100 scale rather than
the observed maximum. Normalising to the max made GPT-Live-1's 16.5%
fill the whole track, which read as a strong result and worked against
the paper's own finding. At true scale the longest bar is a sixth of
the track and the picture matches the claim.

